// La segunda fase de L habilita BC, que sale de B en vez de entrar a B.
simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road AB from A to B
road BC from B to C
light L at B {
	phase green for AB during 30 s
	phase green for BC during 30 s
}
